  <p class="lead-para">
    <strong>Medicine trains people to diagnose and treat patients, while biotechnology works with living systems in labs, plants and data, and the two paths differ in entry rules, length and daily work.</strong> The decisions that unlock high income opportunities include choosing a branch early and building a high-income skill portfolio of finished work, because AI can handle routine tasks but cannot take responsibility for your results.
